      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the info. i'm just really worried about the side effects of antibiotics, i've had bad reactions to them before. i was reading online that oregano oil is a super strong natural antimicrobial. if i take like 3000mg of it a day for a few days, would that be enough to actually kill the bacteria? i really want to try this first before i go to a clinic.",
